description:
Number of AGYW/ABYM who received the required comprehensive package of services during the reporting period.
Criteria:
client falls in the official AGYW/ABYM age/sex group;
services occurred between :startDate and :endDate;
package should contain documented service delivery, not merely risk/problem identification;
recommended package domains available electronically are:
counselling/adherence/peer support,
PHDP/prevention/SRH service,
psychosocial/linkage/referral support.
